WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.240
Tsimikas with the corner again.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.080
And the header is in!

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.320
Ronald Araujo with a peach of a goal.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.160
Dances away from Andrade.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.720
And goes on, and Koumas is there.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.000
And Liverpool have another!

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Bradley Barcola.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.000
It's not gonna count.

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.440
Oh, lovely touch, Barcola.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.880
The excellence of execution
from Bradley Barcola.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.520
And the header is in...

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.000
..from Jeremie Frimpong!

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.160
And it's not gonna count again
for Lewis Koumas.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.520
That's nice -
and he's scored with his first touch.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.080
Ngumoha.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.480
That's nice, little ball for Frimpong.

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:01.320
And arriving is Barcola!

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.960
To make it three for him and five for Liverpool.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:05.600
Frimpong.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:11.000
Unmarked, and finally, Lewis Koumas
has got one that will count.

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:16.800
And across the goal it goes,
and LASK have a second.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.680
The early delivery is looking
for the man arriving -

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:20.680
and it's 6-3.

